  <data name="Panel_EnhancementsToggle_ToolTip" xml:space="preserve"><value>Enables deployment of enhancements for this resource pack. This fixes numerous rendering errors/incompatibilities of vanilla features and resources with ray tracing and enhances various other resources such as particles for ray tracing. For more details, search the following URL: https://minecraftrtx.net/enhancements - It is generally recommended that you keep this enabled, unless it causes issues with another add-on or resource pack you're using.</value></data>

