  <data name="SpecialOccasion_Title.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>Merry Christmas!</value></data>
  <data name="SpecialOccasion_Body.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>Get in the holiday spirit and jolly up Vanilla RTX with this special seasonal extension! Transform the world into a winter wonderland with frost-covered blocks, a freezing-cold Nether plus lots of other festive changes! Ho, ho, ho!
                                           — Cubeir Claus</value></data>
  <data name="SpecialOccasion_DownloadButton.Content" xml:space="preserve"><value>Get the Extension</value></data>
  <data name="SpecialOccasion_OverlayDescription.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>An extension of the Vanilla RTX resource pack, everything is covered in frost! Featuring unyielding cold!</value></data>

  <data name="AddOnsPanel_Description.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>A series of smaller packages that give certain blocks more interesting properties with ray tracing!</value></data>
  <data name="ChemistryPanel_Description.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>Optional Vanilla RTX extensions to extend ray tracing support to Education Edition content!</value></data>
  <data name="CreativePanel_Description.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>Replaces Element block textures with high definition, exotic materials for creative builds with RTX!</value></data>

  <data name="StaticInfo_Text.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>Other optional Vanilla RTX Add-Ons and Extensions can be downloaded and imported manually, they must be activated above one of the three primary Vanilla RTX resource packs in-game, they are not automatically updated by the app, because they rarely receive updated due their limited scope, making them perpetually forward-compatible.</value></data>

